均分 1 分加的子分；AI 草拟，需顾问确认","rank_bonus":{"top10":3,"top30":1,"other":0,"null":0},"rank_bonus_notes":"排名档来自设计文档 §1（前 10% / 30% / 其他，选填）；加分值 AI 草拟，需顾问确认","input":["undergrad_tier","gpa_percent","class_rank"],"undergrad_tier_values_notes":"取值与问卷 seed/questionnaire 的 undergrad_tier 一致：c9 / 985 / 211 / double_first_class / non_key（双非）/ overseas（海本），对应 seed/cn-university 的 C9 / 985 / 211 / 双一流 / 双非；unknown（搜不到）按 non_key 计算（M0-04 约定）。海本 GPA 换算口径另定"},"major_relevance":{"formula":"max(0, level_score[major_relevance] - prereq_penalty * min(missing_prereq_count, prereq_penalty_max_count))","level_score":{"same":100,"related":70,"cross":35},"prereq_penalty":10,"prereq_penalty_max_count":3,"notes":"三档与「缺先修课记风险项」来自设计文档 §1；分值与扣分 AI 草拟，需顾问确认。缺先修课同时输出风险提示","input":["major_relevance","missing_prereq_count"]},"test_scores":{"formula":"按 std_test_type 取一种：gre → clamp(60 + gre_slope * (std_test_total - gre_reference))；gmat_focus → clamp(60 + gmat_slope * (std_test_total - gmat_focus_reference))；gmat_classic → clamp(60 + gmat_slope * (std_test_total - gmat_classic_reference))；未考 → missing_score","gre_reference":320,"gre_slope":4.0,"gmat_focus_reference":645,"gmat_classic_reference":680,"gmat_slope":0.4,"missing_score":50,"not_required_policy":"renormalize","notes":"设计文档 §1：相对目标专业录取中位数的位置，不要求的项目不计入（not_required_policy=renormalize：该项目去掉此维度、其余权重按比例放大）。参考中位数、斜率、未考时的子分均为 AI 草拟，需顾问确认；GMAT Focus 与旧版不互换，分别给参考值（与问卷 std_test_type 一致）","input":["std_test_type","std_test_total"]},"research":{"formula":"research_level = none 时取 none_score；否则 min(100, max(none_score, level_score[research_level] * relevance_factor[research_relevant]) + extra_item_bonus * (research_count - 1))","level_score":{"core_journal":90,"conference":75,"lab_project":55,"none":20},"relevance_factor":{"yes":1.0,"no":0.5},"none_score":20,"extra_item_bonus":5,"notes":"级别（核心期刊 / 会议 / 课题组 / 无）与「按相关度加权」来自设计文档 §1；问卷只采集最高级别、段数、是否相关；分值与系数 AI 草拟，需顾问确认","input":["research_level","research_count","research_relevant"]},"work_experience":{"formula":"none_score + (100 - none_score) * min(effective_months / saturation_months, 1)；effective_months = work_months * company_factor[work_company_tier] * relevance_factor[work_relevant]；无经历时 effective_months = 0","company_factor":{"top":1.0,"normal":0.7},"relevance_factor":{"yes":1.0,"no":0.5},"none_score":20,"saturation_months":9,"saturation_months_by_field":{},"notes":"头部 / 一般、相关 / 不相关、累计月数来自设计文档 §1；问卷按整体采集（累计月数、是否在头部公司、是否相关）；系数与“满分所需月数”AI 草拟，需顾问确认","input":["work_months","work_company_tier","work_relevant"]},"other_soft":{"formula":"awards_level = none 时取 none_score；否则 min(100, level_score[awards_level] + extra_item_bonus * (awards_count - 1))","level_score":{"international":90,"national":75,"provincial":60,"school":45,"none":20},"none_score":20,"extra_item_bonus":5,"notes":"国际 / 国家 / 省级 / 校级来自设计文档 §1；分值 AI 草拟，需顾问确认","input":["awards_level","awards_count"]},"course_match":{"formula":"clamp(100 * course_match_ratio)","applies":false,"notes":"设计文档 §8（德国）：已对口学分 / 目标项目要求学分，由成绩单解析得到；映射方式 AI 草拟，需顾问确认","input":["course_match_ratio"]}},"hard_thresholds":{"source_priority":["program_requirement","defaults_below"],"on_fail":"needs_improvement","on_fail_label":"补足后可申","unverified_flag_when_default_used":true,"notes":"设计文档 §3：先按项目官网要求过滤，不达标的不进冲稳保，单列「补足后可申」。项目库（abr_requirement）有记录时只用项目库；下列默认值只在项目缺记录时兜底，并给结果打「要求待核实」标记","language":{"scale":"ielts_equivalent","defaults_by_difficulty":{"D1":{"overall":7.0,"min_sub":6.5},"D2":{"overall":6.5,"min_sub":6.0},"D3":{"overall":6.5,"min_sub":6.0},"D4":{"overall":6.0,"min_sub":5.5},"D5":{"overall":6.0,"min_sub":5.5}},"notes":"检查总分与小分（设计文档 §3）；托福 / 多邻国按官方对照表换算到雅思尺度（§1，归一化阶段完成）；兜底分值 AI 草拟，需顾问确认"},"min_gpa_by_undergrad_tier":{"defaults_by_difficulty":{"D1":{"c9":87,"985":89,"211":91,"double_first_class":92,"non_key":93,"overseas":83},"D2":{"c9":85,"985":87,"211":89,"double_first_class":90,"non_key":91,"overseas":81},"D3":{"c9":83,"985":85,"211":87,"double_first_class":88,"non_key":89,"overseas":79},"D4":{"c9":82,"985":84,"211":86,"double_first_class":87,"non_key":88,"overseas":78},"D5":{"c9":80,"985":82,"211":84,"double_first_class":85,"non_key":86,"overseas":76}},"undergrad_tiers_not_accepted_by_difficulty":{"D1":[],"D2":[],"D3":[],"D4":[],"D5":[]},"notes":"设计文档 §3「院校层次对应的最低均分」；兜底矩阵 = tier_reference_gpa + 难度档偏移 [5, 3, 1, 0, -2]，AI 草拟，需顾问确认；不接收某层次的情况只按项目库或顾问填写，AI 不预填"},"prerequisites":{"mode":"program_requirement_only","missing_action":"risk_flag","notes":"设计文档 §3、§1：先修课只取项目库；项目标为必需而缺失时判不达标，否则只记风险项"},"work_years":{"mode":"program_requirement_only","notes":"设计文档 §3：工作年限只取项目库"},"cross_major":{"mode":"program_requirement_only","notes":"设计文档 §3：是否接受跨专业只取项目库"}},"probability":{"formula":"P = 1 / (1 + exp(-a * (C - (T + t_offset))))","notes":"公式来自设计文档 §4；T、a 优先取项目自己的参考线（abr_program_benchmark），没有时用 benchmark_defaults 与 a_default","a_default":0.12,"a_notes":"设计文档 §4：项目录取越标准化 a 越大；本国默认值 AI 草拟，需顾问确认；项目有自己的 a（abr_program_benchmark）时优先","t_offset":0.0,"t_offset_notes":"本国不做整体偏移（AI 草拟，需顾问确认）","rounding":{"c_scale":2,"p_scale":4,"mode":"HALF_UP"},"rounding_notes":"保证同一输入同一输出（开发规范 14.1）；位数 AI 草拟"},"tier_cutoffs":{"reach_below":0.35,"safety_above":0.7,"labels":{"reach":"冲","match":"稳","safety":"保"},"boundary_rule":"P < 0.35 → 冲；0.35 ≤ P ≤ 0.70 → 稳；P > 0.70 → 保","student_visible":"tier_label_only","expose_probability_to_student":false,"notes":"设计文档 §4：冲刺 < 35%、主攻 35–70%、保底 > 70%（阈值可调）；对外只展示档位，不展示百分比"},"benchmark_defaults":{"source_priority":["own_cases","official_stats","consultant_difficulty"],"default_source":"consultant_difficulty","difficulty_levels":{"D1":{"t":92,"description":"极难：该国竞争最激烈的项目，名额极少"},"D2":{"t":87,"description":"很难：头部院校的一般项目"},"D3":{"t":82,"description":"中等：录取标准明确、背景达标即有较大机会"},"D4":{"t":76,"description":"较易：对院校层次和均分要求较宽"},"D5":{"t":70,"description":"容易 / 门槛低"}},"notes":"设计文档 §4、§7：冷启动期 T 由顾问按经验给的难度分（五档）决定，每条 T 标明来源；下列各档 T 值与档位说明为 AI 草拟，需顾问确认；排名区间只是帮助顾问定档的参考，不是对任何真实院校的判断"},"portfolio":{"default_mix":{"reach":2,"match":4,"safety":2},"constraints":["total_budget_within_limit","at_least_one_safety_in_first_choice_country"],"notes":"设计文档 §5：默认 2 冲 + 4 稳 + 2 保，总预算不超、至少一所保底在首选国家"},"preference":{"dimensions":["budget","rank_or_employment","city","duration"],"importance":{"high":2,"normal":1},"importance_notes":"问卷 priority_top2：选中的项为 high、未选为 normal（问卷草案「被选 = 高、未选 = 普通」）；分值 AI 草拟，需顾问确认","budget_buckets_wan":{"lt20":20,"20_40":40,"40_60":60,"60_100":100,"gt100":null,"unlimited":null},"budget_notes":"问卷 budget_total 各档的上限（万元人民币，null 为不限）；项目全程费用 = 学费 × 学制年数 × 汇率 + 月生活费 × 学制月数，超出上限的项目不进推荐组合（设计文档 §5「总预算不超」）","cost":{"fx_to_cny":{"SGD":5.5,"CNY":1},"living_cny_per_month":9000},"cost_notes":"汇率与月生活费为 AI 草拟的粗略值，需顾问确认并定期按实际汇率更新；项目币种不在表中或缺学费、学制时费用记为未知（不排除，只提示）","ranking_list":"QS","ranking_points":[[1,100],[10,95],[50,85],[100,70],[200,50],[500,25],[1000,5]],"ranking_notes":"「排名优先 / 都看重」时按院校在该榜单最新一年的名次折线换算 0–100；院校库没有名次时不计这一项；AI 草拟，需顾问确认","employment_notes":"院校库暂无就业数据：学生选「就业优先」时这一项不计分，并提示顾问","metropolis_cities":["Singapore","新加坡"],"city_notes":"问卷 city_preference：院校所在城市在列表中为「国际大都市」，否则为「大学城 / 中小城市」；城市列表 AI 草拟，需顾问确认","duration_points":[[9,100],[12,100],[18,70],[24,40],[36,20]],"duration_notes":"学制（月）折线换算 0–100，越短分越高；AI 草拟，需顾问确认","notes":"设计文档 §5：每档内按「偏好匹配分」排序（预算、排名 vs 就业、城市、学制，重要程度由学生选择）；偏好只影响排序和组合，不进综合分"},"gap_analysis":{"target":"match","target_p":0.35,"changeable":["language","test_scores","research","work_experience"],"actions":[{"code":"ielts_plus_0_5","dimension":"language","min_months":2},{"code":"gre_plus_10","dimension":"test_scores","min_months":2},{"code":"add_lab_research","dimension":"research","min_months":4},{"code":"add_related_internship_3m","dimension":"work_experience","min_months":3}],"notes":"设计文档 §6：对冲刺校反算进入主攻档所需最小提升，只在可改变的维度里找，并按剩余时间判断是否现实；各动作所需月数 AI 草拟，需顾问确认","application_lead_months":6,"application_lead_notes":"差距反算判断「来得及」：所选动作所需月数之和 ≤ 距入学月数 − 递交提前量；提前量 6 个月为 AI 草拟，需顾问确认"},"calibration":{"refit_min_samples_per_country":200,"seasonal_check":{"safety_admit_rate_min":0.7,"match_admit_rate_range":[0.35,0.7],"reach_admit_rate_max":0.35},"deviation_alert":0.1,"notes":"设计文档 §7：约 200 条结果后用逻辑回归重拟合；每季对比各档实际录取率。偏差告警 0.10 为 AI 草拟，需顾问确认"},"country_rules":{"high_reference_line":{"value":true,"notes":"设计文档 §8：名额少、竞争激烈 → 参考线高、保底档少（体现在 benchmark_defaults 的 T 整体高于英澳）"},"mix_application_hint":{"when_safety_count_below":1,"suggest_countries":["UK","AU"],"notes":"设计文档 §8：提示与其他国家混申；触发条件与推荐国家为 AI 草拟，需顾问确认"},"notes":"设计文档 §8 多国家适配"}}$ejson$),
